_011"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长14天）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）","quote_sha256":"07ee676da9169ff7bd8873a4eb194a9fea3f97590a5af13071efd2a7848b5a32","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_012"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_002","es_003","es_007","es_011","es_012"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充IB中sGC-cGMP通路在HFrEF中的机制描述及SGC-R21的非临床药效学数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_01","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床研究报告"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础 - 机制论证部分"},{"action":"补充2.5mg和5mg剂量选择的非临床依据（NOAEL、PK/PD建模、同类药物剂量-暴露-效应关系）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_02","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学报告","PK/PD建模报告"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础 - 剂量选择依据"}],"heading":"本研究的理论基础","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）中sGC-cGMP通路机制描述","SGC-R21非临床药效学与毒理学数据","同类sGC激动剂在HFrEF中的既往临床证据","剂量选择的非临床依据（NOAEL、PK/PD建模）"],"proposal_text":"SMOKE-r2-1（SGC-R21）为口服可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶（sGC）激动剂，属于小分子化合物，通过口服给药实现全身性暴露。sGC是一氧化氮（NO）信号通路的关键效应酶，催化三磷酸鸟苷转化为环磷酸鸟苷（cGMP），后者参与血管舒张、抗纤维化和抗重构等心血管保护过程。在射血分数降低的慢性心力衰竭（HFrEF）中，内皮功能障碍导致NO生物利用度下降，sGC信号通路受损，cGMP生成不足，进而加重血管收缩、心肌纤维化和心室重构。SGC-R21通过直接激活sGC、恢复cGMP信号传导，理论上可改善HFrEF患者的血流动力学和心肌功能。本研究为II期概念验证（PoC）与剂量探索设计，旨在在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上评估SGC-R21对HFrEF患者的初步疗效信号和安全性特征，并为后续确证性研究确定候选剂量。研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，设置SGC-R21低剂量（2.5mg每日一次）和高剂量（5mg每日一次）两个试验组及安慰剂对照组，按1:1:1比例随机分配，治疗持续12周。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：药物为口服sGC激动剂（小分子、全身暴露）；适应症为HFrEF；研究目的为PoC和剂量探索；设计为随机双盲安慰剂对照平行组多中心II期；剂量为2.5mg和5mg QD；治疗12周；1:1:1随机。sGC-cGMP通路在HFrEF中的机制描述为基于药物类别的合理推断，非直接来源于允许来源的机制文本，需医学经理核实。具体非临床药效学数据、同类药物既往证据和剂量选择的非临床依据需补充IB。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_f788d0c5f837f7b6","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a24043c27c77fa3bcb3d31b5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5425c4f8e6c0a6"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001001213_914e213c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"目标研究人群：年龄段：成人；疾病状态：中重度；在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍残留症状的成人HFrEF患者","quote_sha256":"eee2450d9723c5490db6c5a3ab42a40e674f6084a2ff533c46eb680d7202c128","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化（中心实验室，访视窗±7天）","quote_sha256":"f859905b074bcc88cfa5a6e70c590cbbb6a0c04fcbae436697fc3b9da07f0b9f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：第12周6分钟步行距离较基线变化","quote_sha256":"deb2625f8c922a57be11b498fa95e3cb111bfc22077ea36c08d1c7972f5e0353","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：TEAE发生率与严重程度（MedDRA 27.0）；第0、4、12周体位性低血压与收缩压变化","quote_sha256":"f308c4e2dc4f61c3f077cae43d91833eb183f9081fb2e6e4e527401832a77780","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长14天）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）","quote_sha256":"07ee676da9169ff7bd8873a4eb194a9fea3f97590a5af13071efd2a7848b5a32","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_012"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"研究人群概述：年龄18-75岁、LVEF≤40%、NYHA II-III级、在GDMT基础上仍有症状的慢性HFrEF成人受试者","quote_sha256":"df9c7936dd69ef4c5f0247f18fa0d36e82e905494d2d4afcadbcd1b51bac2bcb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_014"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：筛选前6个月内急性心肌梗死、不稳定型心衰或卒中；收缩压<90mmHg；eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m²；妊娠或哺乳期；30天内使用过其他sGC激动剂或PDE5抑制剂","quote_sha256":"00eedca3c214010b6188381ed829bba469eed145f0d64272cdc2c8a954db024e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_015"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_005","es_006","es_010","es_012","es_014","es_015"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充IB中SGC-R21及同类sGC激动剂的已知风险（低血压、头痛、出血倾向等）和非临床毒理学发现","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_25_01","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床毒理学报告","同类药物安全性文献"],"target":"2.5 获益/风险评估 - 风险识别部分"},{"action":"根据IB确认的风险条目，制定对应的监测频率、剂量调整规则和停药标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_25_02","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","安全性监测方案"],"target":"2.5 获益/风险评估 - 风险缓解措施"}],"heading":"获益/风险评估","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册中sGC激动剂类药物的已知风险与安全性信号","同类药物在HFrEF中的安全性数据","SGC-R21非临床毒理学中的靶器官毒性信息"],"proposal_text":"本研究的目标人群为年龄18至75岁、左室射血分数（LVEF）≤40%、NYHA心功能II至III级、在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍存在残留症状的慢性HFrEF成人受试者。该人群代表当前心衰治疗中仍存在显著未满足需求的群体：尽管已接受GDMT，患者仍面临持续的症状负担、运动耐量下降和心衰进展风险。本研究的潜在获益在于：在GDMT基础上加用SGC-R21，通过恢复sGC-cGMP信号通路，可能进一步改善血流动力学、减轻心肌纤维化和心室重构，从而降低NT-proBNP水平并改善运动耐量。主要疗效终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化（中心实验室检测，访视窗±7天），安全性终点为第12周6分钟步行距离（6MWD）较基线变化。安全性评估关注TEAE发生率与严重程度（采用MedDRA 27.0编码），特别关注第0、4、12周的体位性低血压与收缩压变化。排除标准中已纳入收缩压<90mmHg、eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m²、筛选前6个月内急性心肌梗死或不稳定型心衰或卒中、妊娠或哺乳期、30天内使用过其他sGC激动剂或PDE5抑制剂等条件，以降低已知风险人群的暴露。研究时期包括筛选期（最长14天）、双盲治疗期（12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：目标人群定义（成人、中重度、GDMT基础上残留症状的HFrEF）；主要终点（第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化，中心实验室，±7天）；安全性终点（第12周6MWD较基线变化）；特别关注不良事件（TEAE MedDRA 27.0，体位性低血压与SBP变化于D0/W4/W12）；排除标准（SBP<90、eGFR<30、近期心血管事件、妊娠哺乳、sGC/PDE5抑制剂）；研究时期（筛选14天、治疗12周、随访14天）。sGC激动剂类药物的已知风险（如头痛、低血压、出血）未在允许来源中明确列出，需医学经理依据IB确认具体风险条目和监测要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_ec2d11aca98006bf","section_number":"2.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a24043c27c77fa3bcb3d31b5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5425c4f8e6c0a6"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001001213_914e213c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"内在研究目的：概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"2d096e242bbd65d0c9236718d79e77a388e84cb9640b99bd47662a6ce8faab31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化（中心实验室，访视窗±7天）","quote_sha256":"f859905b074bcc88cfa5a6e70c590cbbb6a0c04fcbae436697fc3b9da07f0b9f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：第12周6分钟步行距离较基线变化","quote_sha256":"deb2625f8c922a57be11b498fa95e3cb111bfc22077ea36c08d1c7972f5e0353","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：TEAE发生率与严重程度（MedDRA 27.0）；第0、4、12周体位性低血压与收缩压变化","quote_sha256":"f308c4e2dc4f61c3f077cae43d91833eb183f9081fb2e6e4e527401832a77780","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"样本量策略：假设安慰剂组NT-proBNP平均降15%、试验组降30%、SD=25%，双侧α=0.05、把握度80%，每组约60例，三组180例，加10%脱落约200例","quote_sha256":"939e567b823385cb243381e2bb1985d6802c9e05e281fb18babf4b9b288a5adf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_013"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_007","es_008","es_009","es_010","es_013"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认是否需增加患者报告结局（如KCCQ）或其他次要疗效终点；确认6MWD的终点分类（安全性终点或次要疗效终点）","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_3_01","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"3 研究目的和终点 - 次要终点"},{"action":"确认本研究是否设置探索性目的或探索性终点；当前依据已确认事实，本研究不设置探索性目的/终点","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_3_02","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"3 研究目的和终点 - 探索性目的"}],"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的内在研究目的为概念验证（PoC）与剂量探索，旨在评估口服sGC激动剂SGC-R21在GDMT基础上对慢性HFrEF患者的初步疗效信号和安全性特征，并为后续确证性研究确定候选剂量。主要疗效终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化，由中心实验室检测，访视窗为±7天。安全性终点为第12周6分钟步行距离（6MWD）较基线变化。特别关注的不良事件包括：TEAE发生率与严重程度（采用MedDRA 27.0编码），以及第0、4、12周体位性低血压与收缩压变化。主要估计目标为随机化人群第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化，死亡或心衰住院退出按治疗策略处理。样本量假设安慰剂组NT-proBNP平均下降15%、试验组下降30%、标准差25%，双侧α=0.05、把握度80%，每组约60例，三组共180例，考虑10%脱落率后计划入组约200例。主要终点采用ANCOVA分析（以基线值为协变量、组别为固定效应），安全性数据采用描述统计，全分析集（FAS）与安全集（SS）分别定义。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：内在研究目的（PoC、剂量探索）；主要终点（第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化，中心实验室，±7天）；安全性终点（第12周6MWD较基线变化）；特别关注不良事件（TEAE MedDRA 27.0，体位性低血压与SBP于D0/W4/W12）；估计目标策略；样本量假设与计算；统计分析策略（ANCOVA、描述统计、FAS/SS）。本研究未设置探索性目的或探索性终点。需医学经理确认：是否需增加患者报告结局（如KCCQ）作为次要终点；6MWD是否同时作为疗效终点和安全性终点；NT-proBNP的±7天访视窗是否适用于所有访视。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_d7f0497a507274da","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a24043c27c77fa3bcb3d31b5","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5425c4f8e6c0a6"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"320da8f68e420ad7af5f698e3aa64674befc7bf4d77d5c21c70e31688ffbb921","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_cb40af386f90d99b:full-draft:a24043c27c77fa3bcb3d31b5","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a24043c27c77fa3bcb3d31b5","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:3b2e251e11bb8cba8063752ef5c824857036f2d4a6568821606758be43b3b1f2:a24043c27c77fa3bcb3d31b5","text_sha256":"320da8f68e420ad7af5f698e3aa64674befc7bf4d77d5c21c70e31688ffbb921"},{"content_sha256":"e49aa119fa79fb97c9ada834451eb7ccce1aae054f2913549c0f6b2070265bec","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","text_sha256":"e49aa119fa79fb97